chocolatecake: Sick! I love games.
character: And tell me, what games have you actually played before?
chocolatecake: I’ve played this one game before called…
character: Oh?
chocolatecake: Lethal Combat.
character: ...I'm being real, I seriously thought you wouldn't have played anything.
chocolatecake: Of course I have. Hasn't everyone?
character: Everyone else I've met today hasn't actually 'been anything' that they've said they were. LARPers at their finest.
chocolatecake: Yeah... I mean, there's a reason for that, but that's magical knowledge. You're the one who didn't want to hear the writer's super fleshed out lore that he spent ages on, so...
character: Yeah, it's fine.
character: [i] Damn. Who's 'the writer'? Feels familiar.
chocolatecake: Anyway, back to the game!
character: Right! So, who's your main?
chocolatecake: Uh, mostly Scorpio, but I also dabble in Chonny Rage.
character: Seriously? Same! Scorpio, I mean. I also play Absolute Zero.
chocolatecake: Absolute Zero? Come on, then. Scorpio vs Absolute Zero.
