20 minutes later
character: Oh, come on!
chocolatecake: Hah! Praise the almighty Scorpio! 'Come over here!'
character: Hey, he's absolutely busted! When you played Chonny, I beat you!
chocolatecake: Yeah! Because you used Scorpio!
character: Uh... Shuddup!
chocolatecake: Heh.
character: Okay! Alright, I'll beat you in a different game then!
chocolatecake: Oh, yeah?
character: How about... Uh... Kario Mart!
chocolatecake: Kario Mart? Surprisingly, I don't know that one.
character: AH-HAH! I have the advantage! The high-ground, if you will!
chocolatecake: I... suppose?
character: You're going to eat my dust!
[wait time="1" skippable="true" hide_text="true"]
15 minutes later
character: I... What... No! It's not possible!
chocolatecake: You really do suck at games. 
character: What the HELL!? How are you naturally good at every game known to man!?
chocolatecake: What can I say? I'm just better than you, I guess.
character: Hey, don't you laugh at me! I can see that smile!
chocolatecake: Honestly, I didn't take you for a sore loser.
character: ...
chocolatecake: Look, as fun as it is to curbstomp you in every game known to man, I'm reaching my limit.
character: Damn, alright then. And I was just about to ask if you want to 1v1 in Mammal Crossing.
